    "description": "Matches academic/professional titles followed by a valid name, excluding cases where the title is followed by another title or abbreviation.",
    "content": "(?:Dr\\.|Mag\\.|Mag\\.\\s+Dr\\.|Dr\\.\\s+Mag\\.|Priv\\.-Doz\\.|Priv\\.-Doz\\.in|Univ\\.-Prof\\.|Univ\\.-Prof\\.in|Hon\\.-Prof\\.|Hon\\.-Prof\\.in|PhD|OSR|VetR|KommR|Bakk\\.\\s+phil\\.|LLB|BSc|Dipl\\.-Ing\\.|Dipl\\.-Ing\\.in|DDr\\.|DDr\\.in|Mag\\.\\s+MBA\\s+MSc|Mag\\.\\s+MSc|Mag\\.\\s+MBA|Mag\\.\\s+in|Mag\\.a|Dr\\.in|Ing\\.|RgR|\u00d6kR|Techn\\s+R)\\s+(?!(?:Dr\\.|Mag\\.|Rg\\.|Priv\\.-Doz\\.|Univ\\.-Prof\\.|Hon\\.-Prof\\.|KommR|Techn\\s+R|\u00d6kR|LL\\.M\\.|BSc|Dipl\\.-Ing\\.|PhD|MA|LLB|MSc|MBA|Bakk\\.))([A-Z][a-z\u00e4\u00f6\u00fc\u00df]+(?:\\s+[A-Z][a-z\u00e4\u00f6\u00fc\u00df]+)*(?:\\s+-\\s+[A-Z][a-z\u00e4\u00f6\u00fc\u00df]+)*)"
  }
]

